      "content": "hey, i think i have a UTI or something... it really burns when i go to the bathroom and i feel this constant pressure in my lower belly. i rly dont want to take antibiotics if i can help it. will like, taking a really high dose of oregano oil or concentrated cranberry pills actually kill the bacteria? i just want to fix it before it gets worse",
