      "content": "i mean i know i should probably see someone but i'm just so busy with work and it's so expensive to go to the clinic every time. i've read online that oregano oil is basically a natural antibiotic. if i just took a double or triple dose of the capsules for a few days, wouldn't that be enough to clear it out? i'm just trying to avoid the whole prescription thing if i can just handle it myself.",
